full B08d remain OPEN.

Follow-up, 2026-09-28: musl-wordexp-memory.out records four additional allocation
ownership/error repairs in this same patch. The expanded patch passes 2304/2304
allocation-fault checks and repeats the uninstrumented 576/576 transport checks.
Original entries still fail 24/24 with 71 assertion diagnostics each. The hashes
above identify the historical transport-only result; the follow-up record binds
the expanded patch and newer compiler binary without rewriting that history.
